<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 bg-white">
        <h1 class="fw-bold mb-3">Privacy & Data Governance Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-4">Last Updated: January 2026</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h5>
        <p class="text-muted">
          LUXE respects individual privacy. We collect minimal customer contact details (name, email address, delivery telephone, shipping destinations) strictly for authenticating accounts and fulfilling domestic and international orders.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. Password and Payment Security</h5>
        <p class="text-muted">
          All user passwords are encrypted using multi-round salted bcrypt hashes prior to database persistence. We never store raw payment credentials or credit card numbers on our servers.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. Session and Cookie Policy</h5>
        <p class="text-muted">
          Our application uses encrypted HTTP cookies solely for session continuity, shopping cart persistence, and secure tokenized authentication.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">4. Client Rights</h5>
        <p class="text-muted">
          You hold the absolute right to view, update, or request erasure of your customer profile and historical records at any time through our concierge team.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

